			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 140250102,
					"content": "人齐了，今天也按照计划行动。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250103,
						140250104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250103,
					"content": "稍等一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250105,
					"content": "什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250106,
					"content": "「仆人」跟「博士」合作过吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250107,
					"content": "为什么这么问？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250108,
					"content": "其实，我们昨天晚上见到了克雷薇，这是她告诉我们的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250109,
					"content": "我们在须弥见过「博士」。他不但很危险，而且做过很多坏事！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250110,
					"content": "…我不敢保证「父亲」与「博士」没有来往，但我认为「父亲」不会跟他合作。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250111,
					"content": "我们并非同一派系，相互也不信任，没有合作的基础。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250112,
					"content": "不过，我听说「父亲」刚刚成为执行官的时候，「博士」确实有提过想要跟壁炉之家合作。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250113,
					"content": "「父亲」拒绝了大部分提案，只保留了一个秘密实验。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250114,
					"content": "秘密实验？克雷薇说的该不会就是这个吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250115,
					"content": "应该不是。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250116,
					"content": "我不知道那个秘密实验是什么，但它是壁炉之家独立完成的，「博士」只提供了研究方向，算不上是合作。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250117,
					"content": "而且只是实验内容保密而已，参与实验的人都有完整记录，跟克雷薇说的情况也对不上。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250118,
					"content": "请相信我们。壁炉之家隶属于愚人众，难免会做一些你们无法接受的事情。但我们有自己的规矩，有自己的底线。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250119,
					"content": "呼。那我们就放心了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250120,
					"content": "说实话，如果「仆人」真的和「博士」合作过，做了一些很过分的事情，我也不知道该怎么面对你们了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250121,
					"content": "可是，难道克雷薇在说谎吗？总觉得也不太像…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250122,
					"content": "要是能直接问问「仆人」就好了，但她应该不会轻易告诉我们的吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250123,
					"content": "先开始今天的计划吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250124,
					"content": "「父亲」昨天没有回来，应该还在海岸附近，拜托你们了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250125,
					"content": "琳妮特，你跟我走。菲米尼，你也要小心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250126,
					"content": "开始行动。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250104,
					"content": "我有个问题。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250105
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
