			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 140250301,
					"content": "离接下来的谈判还有点时间，我们就在这聊聊吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250302,
					"content": "很高兴见到你们和我家的孩子相处融洽。孩子想要成长，良好的人际关系是必不可少的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250303,
					"content": "「仆人」…你会怎么处置他们？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250304,
					"content": "林尼、琳妮特、菲米尼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250305,
					"content": "还有菲约尔、南特伊…人还真不少。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250306,
					"content": "我向来对背叛者一视同仁，没有任何特例。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250307,
					"content": "你…你会「杀死」他们吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250308,
					"content": "想为他们求情吗？很遗憾，没有人能改变家的规矩。在这里，所有人都要为自己的言行举止负责。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250309,
					"content": "你、你对他们没有任何感情吗？他们一直叫你「父亲」，而且发自内心地尊敬你！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250310,
					"content": "任何一个组织，若是人情大于规矩，就会迅速走向衰败。更何况是以严格著称的壁炉之家呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250311,
					"content": "唯一能安慰你们的是：作为客人，你们并不在清算范围之内。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250312,
					"content": "没有别的解决办法吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250313
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250313,
					"content": "林尼他们大概能保住性命。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250314,
					"content": "菲约尔、南特伊为首的这些人，再加上克雷薇…他们想要叛逃，那就没有商量的余地了，没有人能带着秘密活着离开。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250315,
					"content": "这…未免太残酷了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250316,
					"content": "这样如何，看在客人的份上，我再多等一段时间。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250317,
					"content": "如果在这期间，林尼他们成功让克雷薇消失，那就销毁了证据，我不会再追究他们的过错。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250318,
					"content": "否则，我会抓住正在干坏事的他们，让所有人受到严酷的惩罚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250319,
						140250320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250319,
					"content": "一言为定。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250321
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250321,
					"content": "放心。还有，这个你们收好，不要再搞丢了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250322,
					"content": "训练一只魔术飞鸟要花不少时间，死了有些可惜。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250323,
					"content": "你、你从哪抓到的——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250324,
					"content": "好了。闲聊到此结束，该做正事了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250325,
					"content": "之所以约你们在这里见面，是因为我要去沫芒宫谈一件事情。跟你们无关，但请你们跟在我身边，不要想回去通风报信。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250326,
					"content": "走吧。时间刚刚好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250320,
					"content": "不许反悔。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250321
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1402504,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1402504
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
